<%# About Us Page %>
<div class="container my-5">
  <div class="text-center mb-4">
    <h1 class="fw-bold text-primary">About Hospital Logs</h1>
    <p class="text-muted fs-5">
      Streamlining COVID-19 patient care through smart data and real-time insights.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-light p-4 rounded shadow-sm">
    <p class="fs-5">
      Welcome to <strong>Hospital Logs</strong> — a dedicated COVID-19 patient management system built to help healthcare professionals monitor, analyze, and respond to pandemic data efficiently.
    </p>

    <p class="fs-5">
      The platform allows you to track individual patient details including name, age, diagnosis, and treatment history, while also integrating global COVID-19 data through three powerful APIs:
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4 text-primary fw-semibold">Integrated COVID APIs</h4>
    <ul class="list-group list-group-flush mb-4">
      <li class="list-group-item">
        <strong>Vaccination Coverage Map:</strong> Visualize global vaccine distribution and coverage using interactive maps.
      </li>
      <li class="list-group-item">
        <strong>Historical Case Trends:</strong> Analyze daily new cases with dynamic charts powered by real-time data.
      </li>
      <li class="list-group-item">
        <strong>Recovery Statistics:</strong> Track global recovery rates and compare outcomes across regions.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h4 class="mt-4 text-primary fw-semibold">Core Features</h4>
    <ul class="list-group list-group-flush mb-4">
      <li class="list-group-item">
        <strong>Patient Profiles:</strong> Upload and manage photos for quick visual identification.
      </li>
      <li class="list-group-item">
        <strong>Diagnosis & Treatment Logs:</strong> Record medical conditions, admission dates, and care urgency.
      </li>
      <li class="list-group-item">
        <strong>Smart Filtering:</strong> Sort patients by age, severity, or treatment timeline.
      </li>
      <li class="list-group-item">
        <strong>Search Tools:</strong> Instantly locate patients using names, diagnoses, or custom filters.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="fs-5">
      Built with <strong>Ruby on Rails</strong> for both frontend and backend, enhanced with <strong>JavaScript</strong> for interactivity, and powered by a <strong>Rails-based database</strong>, Hospital Logs delivers a full-stack solution for pandemic-era healthcare management.
    </p>




    <!-- Project Video Section -->
    <div class="text-center mt-5">
      <h4 class="fw-bold text-primary mb-3">Project Demonstration</h4>
      <p class="text-muted mb-3">Watch this short video overview of how Hospital Logs works in action:</p>
      <div class="ratio ratio-16x9 shadow-sm rounded overflow-hidden">
        
        <!-- youtube project demo video -->
        <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/YOUR_VIDEO_ID" title="Hospital Logs Project Demo" allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>



  </div>
</div>
